  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Enough_Advancements/BH_JEA_Title.png\" alt=\"标题\" width=\"1492\" height=\"428\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">一个为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 添加的模组，可在 JEI 中显示进度。你可以像搜索物品一样搜索它们。即使尚未解锁，它们也会告诉你达成目标所需的步骤！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">点击它们即可查看描述，说明达成该进度所需的具体操作。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/215/jea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"637\" height=\"541\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">由于客户端通常仅了解已完成的进度，因此服务器上也必须安装此模组。</span></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Enough_Advancements/BH_JEA_Bisect.png\" alt=\"广告\" width=\"1492\" height=\"428\"></a><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#广告 #Ad</span>",
